   "source": [
    "# Programando con Python"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "82b45b9f-2c2a-4feb-803e-4caacc8cabed",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Pregunta 1"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "65137896-18f7-435d-912a-beaf134055c1",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Crea una funciÃ³n que reciba los tres coeficientes $a$, $b$ y $c$ para resolver una ecuaciÃ³n de segundo grado. Muestra la soluciÃ³n por pantalla y ayÃºdate de la librerÃ­a `math` para acceder a la funciÃ³n raÃ­z cuadrada."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 1,
   "id": "0da7dc77-c8b9-4dcb-b24f-da5a3a6ce9e3",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import math\n",
    "\n",
    "def ec2grado(a, b, c):\n",
    "    discriminante = b**2 - 4*a*c\n",
    "    if discriminante > 0:\n",
    "        x_1 = (-b + math.sqrt(discriminante))/(2*a)\n",
    "        print(x_1)\n",
    "        x_2 = (-b - math.sqrt(discriminante))/(2*a)\n",
    "        print(\"Ya que el discriminante es mayor que cero entonces la ecuaciÃ³n de segundo grado tiene dos raÃ­ces reales x1 = {} y x2 = {}\".format(x_1, x_2))\n",
    "    elif discriminante == 0:\n",
    "        x = -b/(2*a)\n",
    "        print(\"Ya que el discriminante es cero entonces la ecuaciÃ³n de segundo grado tiene sÃ³lo una raÃ­z real x = {}\".format(x))\n",
    "    else:\n",
    "        print(\"Ya que el discriminante es menor que cero entonces la ecuaciÃ³n no tiene resoluciÃ³n real.\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 2,
   "id": "fffda5ee-2a5d-4faa-a221-00c17e1979f8",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Ya que el discriminante es cero entonces la ecuaciÃ³n de segundo grado tiene sÃ³lo una raÃ­z real x = -0.5\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "ec2grado(4, 4, 1)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "f2788d7c-6ed7-4d52-9957-d86954e498dd",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Pregunta 2"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "db3ca90c-cb33-462a-8c19-4be77f0ad989",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Crea una funciÃ³n que lea una frase de teclado y nos diga si es o no un palÃ­ndromo (frase que se lee igual de izquierda a derecha o al revÃ©s como por ejemplo â€œLa ruta nos aportÃ³ otro paso naturalâ€)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 3,
   "id": "c8a7d0c9-0d02-4743-8c65-a8995560e2f5",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "def string_cleaning(s):\n",
    "    vocales_con_tilde = {\"Ã¡\": \"a\", \"Ã©\": \"e\", \"Ã­\": \"i\", \"Ã³\": \"o\", \"Ãº\": \"u\"}\n",
    "    for key, value in vocales_con_tilde.items():\n",
    "        s = s.replace(key, value) # reemplazo de vocales\n",
    "        s = s.replace(\" \", \"\") # quitar espacios\n",
    "    return s\n",
    "\n",
    "def is_palindrom(s):\n",
    "    for idx, c in enumerate(s):\n",
    "        if s[idx] == s[len(s) -1 -idx]:\n",
    "            continue\n",
    "        else:\n",
    "            print(\"La frase NO es palÃ­ndroma\")\n",
    "            return # salir de la funciÃ³n\n",
    "    print(\"La frase es palÃ­ndroma\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 4,
   "id": "7e4880d7-e4d0-4378-9a84-fdf04530ae85",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdin",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Escribe aquÃ­ tu frase: La ruta nos aportÃ³ otro paso natural\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "frase = str(input(\"Escribe aquÃ­ tu frase:\")).lower()\n",
    "frase = string_cleaning(frase)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 5,
   "id": "2716afbf-5070-4548-ba38-fed7856e94aa",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "La frase es palÃ­ndroma\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "is_palindrom(frase)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "329d46d2-b080-46b3-9798-25f7d1715dbb",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Pregunta 3"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "002620ae-7dab-47fe-9bae-eef268d1a679",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Crea un diccionario que tenga por claves los nÃºmeros del 1 al 10 y como valores sus raÃ­ces cuadradas."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 6,
   "id": "636c44f8-f03f-44b5-b1e8-aef0b66afc2c",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "diccionario = {}"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 7,
   "id": "c58fa9ca-f777-4db6-9461-e40334aeb1f7",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import math\n",
    "\n",
    "for i in range(1, 11):\n",
    "    diccionario[i] = math.sqrt(i)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 8,
   "id": "10e4f6d8-7237-4cfc-aeb4-2f30503d3303",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "text/plain": [
       "{1: 1.0,\n",
       " 2: 1.4142135623730951,\n",
       " 3: 1.7320508075688772,\n",
       " 4: 2.0,\n",
       " 5: 2.23606797749979,\n",
       " 6: 2.449489742783178,\n",
       " 7: 2.6457513110645907,\n",
       " 8: 2.8284271247461903,\n",
       " 9: 3.0,\n",
       " 10: 3.1622776601683795}"
      ]
     },
     "execution_count": 8,
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "execute_result"
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "diccionario"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "2639efec-4425-423d-b600-6d81e66eda0f",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Pregunta 4"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "7a8b785c-773a-4ea3-a049-3cb4fbdf503a",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Crea un diccionario que tenga como claves las letras del alfabeto castellano y como valores los sÃ­mbolos del cÃ³digo morse (los tienes todos en la Wikipedia). A continuaciÃ³n crea una funciÃ³n que lea una frase del teclado y te la convierta a morse utilizando el diccionario anterior."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 9,
   "id": "0954718c-5313-4a1c-bdc8-a02224afa602",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "diccionario = {\n",
    "    \"A\": \".-\",\n",
    "    \"B\": \"-...\",\n",
    "    \"C\": \"-.-.\",\n",
    "    \"CH\": \"----\",\n",
    "    \"D\": \"-..\",\n",
    "    \"E\": \".\",\n",
    "    \"F\": \"..-.\",\n",
    "    \"G\": \"--.\",\n",
    "    \"H\": \"....\",\n",
    "    \"I\": \"..\",\n",
    "    \"J\": \".---\",\n",
    "    \"K\": \"-.-\",\n",
    "    \"L\": \".-..\",\n",
    "    \"M\": \"--\",\n",
    "    \"N\": \"-.\",\n",
    "    \"Ã‘\": \"--.--\",\n",
    "    \"O\": \"---\",\n",
    "    \"P\": \".--.\",\n",
    "    \"Q\": \"--.-\",\n",
    "    \"R\": \".-.\",\n",
    "    \"S\": \"...\",\n",
    "    \"T\": \"-\",\n",
    "    \"U\": \"..-\",\n",
    "    \"V\": \"...-\",\n",
    "    \"W\": \".--\",\n",
    "    \"X\": \"-..-\",\n",
    "    \"Y\": \"-.--\",\n",
    "    \"Z\": \"--..\"\n",
    "}"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 10,
   "id": "7f636049-95c9-4006-87df-c2ce0dbc24d1",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdin",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Introduzca una frase: Esto es una frase en morse\n"
     ]
    },
    {
     "data": {
      "text/plain": [
       "'. ... - ---   . ...   ..- -. .-   ..-. .-. .- ... .   . -.   -- --- .-. ... .'"
      ]
     },
     "execution_count": 10,
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "execute_result"
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "s = str(input(\"Introduzca una frase:\")).upper()\n",
    "\n",
    "morse_list = []\n",
    "\n",
    "for c in s:\n",
    "    \n",
    "    # si el caracter leÃ­do es un espacio guardamos un espacio en la lista cesar_list\n",
    "    if c == \" \":\n",
    "        morse_list.append(\" \")\n",
    "        continue\n",
    "        \n",
    "    morse_list.append(diccionario[c])\n",
    "\n",
    "frase_morse = \" \".join(morse_list)\n",
    "frase_morse\n",
    "\n",
    "# Un espacio entre letras y tres espacios entre palabras"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "12827b35-be2a-4e15-9643-2518d31c00c9",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Pregunta 5"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "c360f860-62e7-4f5a-81f3-3da7689f7bc1",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Crea una funciÃ³n que dados dos diccionarios nos diga quÃ© claves estÃ¡n presentes en ambos."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 11,
   "id": "71ca42bb-bc5e-4706-959d-6e6f3cbee922",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "text/plain": [
       "['pera', 'manzana']"
      ]
     },
     "execution_count": 11,
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "execute_result"
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "# SoluciÃ³n copiada de las soluciones porque entendÃ­ mal el enunciado\n",
    "def clavesIguales(d1, d2):\n",
    "    l = []\n",
    "    for key in d1:\n",
    "        if key in d2:\n",
    "            l.append(key)\n",
    "    return l\n",
    "\n",
    "d1 = {\"pera\": 1, \"manzana\": 2, \"cereza\": 5, \"sandia\": 3}\n",
    "d2 = {\"manzana\": 5, \"melon\": 1, \"pera\": 7, \"melocoton\": 4}\n",
    "\n",
    "clavesIguales(d1, d2)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "f8c57bc8-cb4b-40bd-b2cf-ca7728c3a222",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Pregunta 6"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "dcbdc4c1-7200-4b3b-a9bb-d37a57ff14ff",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Crea una funciÃ³n que dado un nÃºmero $N$ nos diga si es primo o no (tiene que ir dividiendo por todos los nÃºmeros x comprendidos entre $2$ y el nÃºmero $N âˆ’ 1$ y ver si la divisiÃ³n de $\\frac{N}{x}$ tiene resto cero o no)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 12,
   "id": "7855f8ac-b46d-431c-a1cc-dcf26a27e97b",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "def is_prime(N):\n",
    "    for x in range(2, N):\n",
    "        if N % x == 0:\n",
    "            print(\"El nÃºmero NO es primo\")\n",
    "            return\n",
    "    print(\"El nÃºmero es primo\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 13,
   "id": "92bd15a7-b597-4175-b755-59ab10864e28",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "El nÃºmero es primo\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "n = 11\n",
    "\n",
    "is_prime(n)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "4f06ee7c-d3ee-45f2-9265-be9d1ec7ea2d",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Pregunta 7"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "f55cacd9-f6d1-4ab4-863a-383592e8249d",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Investiga la documentaciÃ³n de la clase `string` y crea un mÃ©todo que lea una frase del teclado y escriba la primera letra de cada palabra en MayÃºscula."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 14,
   "id": "2d49fa91-3803-4d61-8ccf-fc076e00ce50",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "def primera_letra_mayus(frase):\n",
    "    return frase.title() # utilizando el mÃ©todo title() se escribe la primera letra de cada palabra en mayÃºscula"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 15,
   "id": "bec36ed7-1517-4655-aa1e-07f09d73f490",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdin",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Escribe aquÃ­ tu frase: estoy dentro del curso de estadÃ­stica descriptiva en frogames formaciÃ³n\n"
     ]
    },
    {
     "data": {
      "text/plain": [
       "'Estoy Dentro Del Curso De EstadÃ­stica Descriptiva En Frogames FormaciÃ³n'"
      ]
     },
     "execution_count": 15,
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "execute_result"
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "frase = str(input(\"Escribe aquÃ­ tu frase:\"))\n",
    "\n",
    "primera_letra_mayus(frase)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "bcc60a67-a57a-429d-af2d-12b4a6372200",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Pregunta 8"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "933e3a36-0a52-4971-804a-1d5603301f03",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Crea una funciÃ³n que calcule el mÃ¡ximo comÃºn divisor de dos nÃºmeros introducidos por el usuario por teclado."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 16,
   "id": "c058605f-05c1-4f70-b6fe-355d0cc1b2fc",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdin",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Introduzca el primer nÃºmero: 12\n",
      "Introduzca el segundo nÃºmero: 16\n"
     ]
    },
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "El mÃ¡ximo comÃºn divisor de 12 y 16 es 4\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "n1 = int(input(\"Introduzca el primer nÃºmero:\"))\n",
    "n2 = int(input(\"Introduzca el segundo nÃºmero:\"))\n",
    "\n",
    "multiplos_1 = []\n",
    "multiplos_2 = []\n",
    "\n",
    "# calcular mÃºltiplos del primer nÃºmero\n",
    "for mult in range(1, n1 + 1):\n",
    "    if n1 % mult == 0:\n",
    "        multiplos_1.append(mult)\n",
    "\n",
    "# calcular mÃºltiplos del segundo nÃºmero\n",
    "for mult in range(1, n2 + 1):\n",
    "    if n2 % mult == 0:\n",
    "        multiplos_2.append(mult)\n",
    "\n",
    "# quedarnos con Ãºltimo mÃºltiplo comÃºn (el mÃ¡s alto) de ambas listas\n",
    "for i in multiplos_1:\n",
    "    if i in multiplos_2:\n",
    "        mcd = i\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"El mÃ¡ximo comÃºn divisor de {} y {} es {}\".format(n1, n2, mcd))"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "c347b2a9-066e-4ca3-b56a-9a9f3ebf3945",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Pregunta 9"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "b38bae8b-8c98-463f-9d59-432bff22fc3b",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Investiga el Cifrado del CÃ©sar y crea una funciÃ³n que lo reproduzca en Python. Cada letra del mensaje original se desplaza tres posiciones en el alfabeto estÃ¡ndar. La A se convierte en la D, la B se convierte en la E, la C se convierte en la F... y cuando se acaba el alfabeto se le vuelve a dar la vuelta: la X se convierte en la A, la Y en la B y la Z en la C. Los nÃºmeros no sufren ninguna modificaciÃ³n."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 17,
   "id": "a5bfef1b-7a16-4d7a-90d8-f9830c4abd87",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdin",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Introduzca una frase: Esto es una frase en el cifrado del Cesar\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "frase = str(input(\"Introduzca una frase:\")).upper()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 18,
   "id": "c5a06a3e-0aec-4421-a8b9-f7d3dabd846e",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "def cifrado_cesar(n, s):\n",
    "    cesar_list = []\n",
    "    \n",
    "    # si el caracter leÃ­do es un espacio guardamos un espacio en la lista cesar_list\n",
    "    for c in s:\n",
    "        if c == \" \":\n",
    "            cesar_list.append(\" \")\n",
    "            continue\n",
    "            \n",
    "        c_new = chr(ord(c) + n)\n",
    "        if ord(c_new) > 90:\n",
    "            c_new = chr(ord(c_new) - 26)\n",
    "        cesar_list.append(c_new)\n",
    "        \n",
    "    frase_cifrada = \"\".join(cesar_list)\n",
    "    return frase_cifrada"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 19,
   "id": "3326ceb0-ce0f-4b14-a1b8-2e5a8996c99f",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "text/plain": [
       "'HVWR HV XQD IUDVH HQ HO FLIUDGR GHO FHVDU'"
      ]
     },
     "execution_count": 19,
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "execute_result"
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "cifrado_cesar(3, frase)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "c617d223-0d05-4b70-9c54-4a5d91e5802e",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Pregunta 10"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "58d21196-8343-40bf-a792-2d331bfc8b8c",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Dada una lista de nombres de persona, escribe una funciÃ³n que los ordene de tres formas diferentes:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 20,
   "id": "be0512b1-907f-41de-8b7b-81d8b89af817",
   "metadata": {},
